{"seg": 1, "speaker": "A", "chars": 18, "text": "开播前，我习惯先热一下嗓子，再开口。", "t0": 677465.989387, "t1": 677476.598949, "dur_ms": 10609.56, "wall": "2026-09-18T11:53:17", "llm_end": null, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.07], ["s0_enter", 0.08], ["s1_load", 0.09], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.54], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.55], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.59], ["s5_infer", 5038.78], ["s6_guard", 5039.64], ["s7_save_wav", 5045.55], ["s8_write_cache", 5062.71], ["s9_vram", 5064.03], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 5064.05], ["l2_named_copy", 5086.82], ["l3_progress_cb", 10609.56]], "audio_ms": 4400, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 2, "speaker": "B", "chars": 18, "text": "对，别一上来就飙高音，声带容易发紧。", "t0": 677476.601124, "t1": 677488.399518, "dur_ms": 11798.39, "wall": "2026-09-18T11:53:29", "llm_end": null, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.08], ["s0_enter", 0.08], ["s1_load", 0.09], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.52], ["s3_tmpdir", 24.43], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 24.48], ["s5_infer", 6229.47], ["s6_guard", 6230.2], ["s7_save_wav", 6235.21], ["s8_write_cache", 6254.46], ["s9_vram", 6255.09], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 6255.11], ["l2_named_copy", 6277.27], ["l3_progress_cb", 11798.39]], "audio_ms": 5640, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 3, "speaker": "A", "chars": 7, "text": "你一般怎么热？", "t0": 677488.401421, "t1": 677496.742516, "dur_ms": 8341.09, "wall": "2026-09-18T11:53:37", "llm_end": null, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.08], ["s0_enter", 0.08], ["s1_load", 0.08], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.73], ["s3_tmpdir", 21.05], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 21.09], ["s5_infer", 2759.55], ["s6_guard", 2760.21], ["s7_save_wav", 2765.16], ["s8_write_cache", 2784.08], ["s9_vram", 2784.89], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 2784.91], ["l2_named_copy", 2807.05], ["l3_progress_cb", 8341.09]], "audio_ms": 1840, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 4, "speaker": "A", "chars": 9, "text": "我只会随便哼两句。", "t0": 677496.744072, "t1": 677506.481786, "dur_ms": 9737.71, "wall": "2026-09-18T11:53:47", "llm_end": null, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.08], ["s0_enter", 0.25], ["s1_load", 0.25], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.45], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.3], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.34], ["s5_infer", 4165.22], ["s6_guard", 4165.81], ["s7_save_wav", 4171.08], ["s8_write_cache", 4190.82], ["s9_vram", 4191.54], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 4191.56], ["l2_named_copy", 4213.77], ["l3_progress_cb", 9737.7]], "audio_ms": 3160, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 5, "speaker": "B", "chars": 17, "text": "先慢吸气，再轻轻发啊音，别太用力。", "t0": 677506.483419, "t1": 677518.179487, "dur_ms": 11696.07, "wall": "2026-09-18T11:53:59", "llm_end": null, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.08], ["s0_enter", 0.09], ["s1_load", 0.09], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.31], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.03], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.07], ["s5_infer", 6138.98], ["s6_guard", 6139.8], ["s7_save_wav", 6144.37], ["s8_write_cache", 6163.74], ["s9_vram", 6164.53], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 6164.55], ["l2_named_copy", 6186.94], ["l3_progress_cb", 11696.06]], "audio_ms": 5440, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 6, "speaker": "A", "chars": 18, "text": "原来重点是放松，不是把声音拉得多高。", "t0": 677518.181085, "t1": 677528.98132, "dur_ms": 10800.23, "wall": "2026-09-18T11:54:10", "llm_end": null, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.07], ["s0_enter", 0.08], ["s1_load", 0.08], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.26], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.19], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.24], ["s5_infer", 5233.38], ["s6_guard", 5234.07], ["s7_save_wav", 5242.22], ["s8_write_cache", 5261.75], ["s9_vram", 5262.54], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 5262.55], ["l2_named_copy", 5284.62], ["l3_progress_cb", 10800.22]], "audio_ms": 4440, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 7, "speaker": "B", "chars": 16, "text": "对，舒服地开口，状态自然就来了。", "t0": 677528.983137, "t1": 677539.338508, "dur_ms": 10355.37, "wall": "2026-09-18T11:54:20", "llm_end": null, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.1], ["s0_enter", 0.11], ["s1_load", 0.11], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.4], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.48], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.52], ["s5_infer", 4766.56], ["s6_guard", 4767.26], ["s7_save_wav", 4772.23], ["s8_write_cache", 4792.21], ["s9_vram", 4792.88], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 4793.15], ["l2_named_copy", 4815.13], ["l3_progress_cb", 10355.36]], "audio_ms": 4000, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 8, "speaker": "A", "chars": 10, "text": "那开播后还能补热吗？", "t0": 677539.340207, "t1": 677548.305096, "dur_ms": 8964.89, "wall": "2026-09-18T11:54:29", "llm_end": null, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.07], ["s0_enter", 0.08], ["s1_load", 0.08], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.29], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.34], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.38], ["s5_infer", 3412.2], ["s6_guard", 3413.0], ["s7_save_wav", 3417.73], ["s8_write_cache", 3438.18], ["s9_vram", 3439.18], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 3439.21], ["l2_named_copy", 3461.59], ["l3_progress_cb", 8964.88]], "audio_ms": 2760, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 9, "speaker": "A", "chars": 7, "text": "还是得提前做？", "t0": 677548.306916, "t1": 677556.874513, "dur_ms": 8567.6, "wall": "2026-09-18T11:54:37", "llm_end": null, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.09], ["s0_enter", 0.1], ["s1_load", 0.1], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.3], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.46], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.51], ["s5_infer", 3008.29], ["s6_guard", 3009.12], ["s7_save_wav", 3012.97], ["s8_write_cache", 3032.62], ["s9_vram", 3033.31], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 3033.33], ["l2_named_copy", 3056.08], ["l3_progress_cb", 8567.59]], "audio_ms": 2240, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 10, "speaker": "B", "chars": 16, "text": "最好提前，中途再热反而打断节奏。", "t0": 677556.876524, "t1": 677568.032968, "dur_ms": 11156.44, "wall": "2026-09-18T11:54:49", "llm_end": null, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.09], ["s0_enter", 0.1], ["s1_load", 0.1], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.33], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.05], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.09], ["s5_infer", 5596.19], ["s6_guard", 5596.82], ["s7_save_wav", 5602.37], ["s8_write_cache", 5622.04], ["s9_vram", 5622.7], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 5622.72], ["l2_named_copy", 5644.46], ["l3_progress_cb", 11156.44]], "audio_ms": 4800, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 1, "speaker": "A", "chars": 19, "text": "你有没有发现，老歌一响，人就容易走神。", "t0": 677588.755673, "t1": 677599.454544, "dur_ms": 10698.87, "wall": "2026-09-18T11:55:20", "llm_end": null, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.06], ["s0_enter", 0.06], ["s1_load", 0.07], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.46], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.76], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.8], ["s5_infer", 5114.15], ["s6_guard", 5114.83], ["s7_save_wav", 5123.13], ["s8_write_cache", 5142.54], ["s9_vram", 5143.37], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 5143.39], ["l2_named_copy", 5168.38], ["l3_progress_cb", 10698.86]], "audio_ms": 4480, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 2, "speaker": "B", "chars": 21, "text": "太常见了，前奏刚出来，画面就自己冒出来了。", "t0": 677599.456231, "t1": 677611.426955, "dur_ms": 11970.72, "wall": "2026-09-18T11:55:32", "llm_end": null, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.07], ["s0_enter", 0.08], ["s1_load", 0.08], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.26], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.29], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.34], ["s5_infer", 6413.03], ["s6_guard", 6413.78], ["s7_save_wav", 6421.69], ["s8_write_cache", 6440.94], ["s9_vram", 6441.67], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 6441.68], ["l2_named_copy", 6464.11], ["l3_progress_cb", 11970.71]], "audio_ms": 5840, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 3, "speaker": "A", "chars": 19, "text": "那今天就来聊聊，为什么老歌记得这么牢。", "t0": 677611.428338, "t1": 677621.494786, "dur_ms": 10066.45, "wall": "2026-09-18T11:55:42", "llm_end": null, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.09], ["s0_enter", 0.09], ["s1_load", 0.1], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.3], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.39], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.44], ["s5_infer", 4509.88], ["s6_guard", 4510.53], ["s7_save_wav", 4515.48], ["s8_write_cache", 4534.62], ["s9_vram", 4535.28], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 4535.3], ["l2_named_copy", 4558.73], ["l3_progress_cb", 10066.44]], "audio_ms": 3920, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 4, "speaker": "B", "chars": 19, "text": "先说个常识，音乐和情绪走的是同一条路。", "t0": 677621.496105, "t1": 677633.431115, "dur_ms": 11935.01, "wall": "2026-09-18T11:55:54", "llm_end": null, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.09], ["s0_enter", 0.1], ["s1_load", 0.1], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.3], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.32], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.37], ["s5_infer", 6366.38], ["s6_guard", 6367.0], ["s7_save_wav", 6374.7], ["s8_write_cache", 6394.37], ["s9_vram", 6395.03], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 6395.05], ["l2_named_copy", 6417.75], ["l3_progress_cb", 11935.0]], "audio_ms": 5880, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 5, "speaker": "A", "chars": 19, "text": "你是说，听歌的时候情绪被一起存进去了。", "t0": 677633.432528, "t1": 677644.246763, "dur_ms": 10814.24, "wall": "2026-09-18T11:56:05", "llm_end": null, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.08], ["s0_enter", 0.09], ["s1_load", 0.09], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.28], ["s3_tmpdir", 0.98], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.02], ["s5_infer", 5242.27], ["s6_guard", 5242.96], ["s7_save_wav", 5248.49], ["s8_write_cache", 5267.73], ["s9_vram", 5268.82], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 5268.84], ["l2_named_copy", 5290.67], ["l3_progress_cb", 10814.23]], "audio_ms": 4600, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 6, "speaker": "B", "chars": 18, "text": "对，情绪一强，记忆就容易被标上重点。", "t0": 677644.248317, "t1": 677655.61623, "dur_ms": 11367.91, "wall": "2026-09-18T11:56:16", "llm_end": null, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.1], ["s0_enter", 0.11], ["s1_load", 0.11], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.39], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.32], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.35], ["s5_infer", 5825.05], ["s6_guard", 5825.7], ["s7_save_wav", 5830.92], ["s8_write_cache", 5849.04], ["s9_vram", 5849.7], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 5849.72], ["l2_named_copy", 5871.9], ["l3_progress_cb", 11367.91]], "audio_ms": 5080, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 7, "speaker": "A", "chars": 20, "text": "所以那些年发生的事，就跟着旋律绑在一起。", "t0": 677655.61799, "t1": 677667.397679, "dur_ms": 11779.69, "wall": "2026-09-18T11:56:28", "llm_end": null, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.1], ["s0_enter", 0.11], ["s1_load", 0.11], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.32], ["s3_tmpdir", 0.91], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 0.95], ["s5_infer", 6216.25], ["s6_guard", 6217.06], ["s7_save_wav", 6224.67], ["s8_write_cache", 6243.93], ["s9_vram", 6244.65], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 6244.66], ["l2_named_copy", 6267.16], ["l3_progress_cb", 11779.68]], "audio_ms": 5480, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 8, "speaker": "B", "chars": 18, "text": "而且老歌往往不是只听一次，是反复听。", "t0": 677667.398869, "t1": 677678.555751, "dur_ms": 11156.88, "wall": "2026-09-18T11:56:39", "llm_end": null, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.07], ["s0_enter", 0.08], ["s1_load", 0.08], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.27], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.32], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.36], ["s5_infer", 5605.14], ["s6_guard", 5605.75], ["s7_save_wav", 5613.95], ["s8_write_cache", 5632.57], ["s9_vram", 5633.39], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 5633.41], ["l2_named_copy", 5656.3], ["l3_progress_cb", 11156.87]], "audio_ms": 4880, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 9, "speaker": "A", "chars": 17, "text": "反复这件事，本身就特别有利于记忆。", "t0": 677678.557706, "t1": 677689.102354, "dur_ms": 10544.65, "wall": "2026-09-18T11:56:50", "llm_end": null, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.1], ["s0_enter", 0.11], ["s1_load", 0.11], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.41], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.5], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.54], ["s5_infer", 4943.15], ["s6_guard", 4943.83], ["s7_save_wav", 4952.35], ["s8_write_cache", 4971.02], ["s9_vram", 4971.76], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 4971.78], ["l2_named_copy", 4995.0], ["l3_progress_cb", 10544.64]], "audio_ms": 4440, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 10, "speaker": "B", "chars": 17, "text": "同一首歌，可能在很多场合都出现过。", "t0": 677689.104002, "t1": 677700.09886, "dur_ms": 10994.86, "wall": "2026-09-18T11:57:01", "llm_end": null, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.11], ["s0_enter", 0.12], ["s1_load", 0.12], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.35], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.35], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.39], ["s5_infer", 5441.39], ["s6_guard", 5442.03], ["s7_save_wav", 5450.1], ["s8_write_cache", 5469.09], ["s9_vram", 5470.16], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 5470.17], ["l2_named_copy", 5491.99], ["l3_progress_cb", 10994.85]], "audio_ms": 4680, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 11, "speaker": "A", "chars": 17, "text": "场合一多，能勾出它的线索也就多了。", "t0": 677700.100447, "t1": 677710.686777, "dur_ms": 10586.33, "wall": "2026-09-18T11:57:11", "llm_end": null, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.1], ["s0_enter", 0.11], ["s1_load", 0.11], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.36], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.06], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.1], ["s5_infer", 5004.28], ["s6_guard", 5004.96], ["s7_save_wav", 5009.58], ["s8_write_cache", 5029.61], ["s9_vram", 5030.52], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 5030.53], ["l2_named_copy", 5053.48], ["l3_progress_cb", 10586.32]], "audio_ms": 4480, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 12, "speaker": "B", "chars": 17, "text": "还有一点，年轻时听的东西印象更深。", "t0": 677710.688372, "t1": 677721.709267, "dur_ms": 11020.9, "wall": "2026-09-18T11:57:22", "llm_end": null, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.07], ["s0_enter", 0.08], ["s1_load", 0.08], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.26], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.15], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.19], ["s5_infer", 5440.62], ["s6_guard", 5441.32], ["s7_save_wav", 5448.44], ["s8_write_cache", 5468.79], ["s9_vram", 5469.53], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 5469.55], ["l2_named_copy", 5491.79], ["l3_progress_cb", 11020.89]], "audio_ms": 4720, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 13, "speaker": "A", "chars": 16, "text": "你是说十几岁到二十出头那段时期。", "t0": 677721.710668, "t1": 677732.916425, "dur_ms": 11205.76, "wall": "2026-09-18T11:57:33", "llm_end": null, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.08], ["s0_enter", 0.08], ["s1_load", 0.09], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.27], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.15], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.19], ["s5_infer", 5642.01], ["s6_guard", 5642.58], ["s7_save_wav", 5647.16], ["s8_write_cache", 5666.95], ["s9_vram", 5667.83], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 5667.85], ["l2_named_copy", 5690.0], ["l3_progress_cb", 11205.75]], "audio_ms": 5080, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 14, "speaker": "B", "chars": 19, "text": "据我了解，那段时间情绪起伏大，记得牢。", "t0": 677732.91784, "t1": 677777.250946, "dur_ms": 44333.11, "wall": "2026-09-18T11:58:18", "llm_end": null, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.09], ["s0_enter", 0.09], ["s1_load", 0.09], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.28], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.0], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.04], ["s5_infer", 16496.43], ["s6_guard", 38766.63], ["s7_save_wav", 38771.61], ["s8_write_cache", 38790.83], ["s9_vram", 38791.6], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 38791.61], ["l2_named_copy", 38813.87], ["l3_progress_cb", 44333.1]], "audio_ms": 5480, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 15, "speaker": "A", "chars": 17, "text": "那为什么有的人一听到老歌就想哭呢。", "t0": 677777.252638, "t1": 677787.41086, "dur_ms": 10158.22, "wall": "2026-09-18T11:58:28", "llm_end": null, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.1], ["s0_enter", 0.11], ["s1_load", 0.11], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.4], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.43], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.47], ["s5_infer", 4582.66], ["s6_guard", 4583.32], ["s7_save_wav", 4587.78], ["s8_write_cache", 4608.56], ["s9_vram", 4609.3], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 4609.32], ["l2_named_copy", 4632.35], ["l3_progress_cb", 10158.21]], "audio_ms": 3720, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 16, "speaker": "B", "chars": 15, "text": "大概不只是歌，是那时候的自己。", "t0": 677787.412836, "t1": 677798.288334, "dur_ms": 10875.5, "wall": "2026-09-18T11:58:39", "llm_end": null, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.08], ["s0_enter", 0.09], ["s1_load", 0.09], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.32], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.3], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.34], ["s5_infer", 5310.34], ["s6_guard", 5311.07], ["s7_save_wav", 5315.67], ["s8_write_cache", 5336.33], ["s9_vram", 5336.97], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 5336.98], ["l2_named_copy", 5358.83], ["l3_progress_cb", 10875.49]], "audio_ms": 4880, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 17, "speaker": "A", "chars": 14, "text": "这么一说，老歌更像一把钥匙。", "t0": 677798.289583, "t1": 677808.490236, "dur_ms": 10200.65, "wall": "2026-09-18T11:58:49", "llm_end": null, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.07], ["s0_enter", 0.08], ["s1_load", 0.08], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.27], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.28], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.32], ["s5_infer", 4644.3], ["s6_guard", 4644.92], ["s7_save_wav", 4653.04], ["s8_write_cache", 4673.05], ["s9_vram", 4673.8], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 4673.81], ["l2_named_copy", 4696.44], ["l3_progress_cb", 10200.65]], "audio_ms": 4000, "cached": false, "ok": true}
